body:
@dsnopek and I discussed this and I think the latest patchset reflects the changes.

Basically `swapchain_update_state_ext->is_enabled()` checked for `XR_FB_swapchain_update_state` and `XR_FB_swapchain_update_state_vulkan`, but only `XR_FB_swapchain_update_state` was supported on the platform I am running on. 

Since only `OpenXRFBUpdateSwapchainExtension::update_swapchain_state()` required (and already checked for) `XR_FB_swapchain_update_state_vulkan`, I just changed `swapchain_update_state_ext->is_enabled()` to only check for `XR_FB_swapchain_update_state`.
